@startuml activity-edit-product
' Edit or delete a product (Administration module).
' Deleting archives the product (status ARCHIVED): it is never removed.

title Edit / delete product

|Admin|
|Coffee Shop System|
|Image host|

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Products;
|Coffee Shop System|
:Show the products;
|Admin|
if (What next?) then ([edit])
  repeat
    :2 · Change the details, then click Save;
    |Coffee Shop System|
    :Check the form\n(fields and images);
  backward :Show the errors\non the marked fields;
  repeat while (Valid?) is ([no]) not ([yes])
  if (New images?) then ([yes])
    |Image host|
    :Store the new images;
  else ([no])
  endif
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Save the product;
else ([delete])
  |Admin|
  :3 · Click Delete, then confirm;
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Archive the product\n(status ARCHIVED);
endif
:Show the updated list;
stop

@enduml
